+---
+id: task-002-add-availability-query-to-the-rental-service
+type: task
+title: "Add availability(query) to the rental service"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold, setting only `id`, `title` and
+     `status` (and any `--tags` or `--set` value). Fill the required frontmatter fields and replace
+     these placeholder comments yourself; `wingfoil memory submit` then checks the required fields,
+     moves `status` forward and commits the document as you left it, naming in the commit body the
+     content it carries. -->
+
+Added `availability({ start, end, kind? })` to the rental service. It returns the sorted ids of the
+equipment (of the given kind, or any) with no booking overlapping the half-open period, as in dl-001.
+The period is validated like a rental's; an unknown kind throws. The overlap check is shared with `book`.
+Tests added in `test/rental.test.ts` (happy path, kind filter, adjacent booking, error paths); all pass.
